WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:11.845
(NEW SOULS COOING)

2
00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:21.271
No, wait, Neptune, trust me.
Do not go to Earth. It's not worth it.

3
00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:24.233
That place is dirty
and wet and lonely and...

4
00:00:24.316 --> 00:00:27.861
Come on, Neptune, remember our,
our spontaneous dance party.

5
00:00:27.945 --> 00:00:31.448
What? Stay here with me
if you wanna get funky!

6
00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:33.116
But I can go to Earth now.

7
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.161
Yes, you can. Congratulations.
You completed your Earth Pass.

8
00:00:36.245 --> 00:00:38.205
-And 22 did not.
-COUNSELOR JERRY A: Not yet.

9
00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:39.748
She has no reason to live.

10
00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:41.625
COUNSELOR JERRY B: She's working on it.

11
00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.210
HAPPY SOUL 1: Whee!

12
00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:45.295
(HAPPY SOULS CHUCKLING)

13
00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:49.716
Oh, what makes you so great,
you stupid floating rock?

14
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.260
Stealin' all my friends.

15
00:00:51.343 --> 00:00:53.136
How would you like it if I...

16
00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:57.641
If I stopped souls from visiting you?

17
00:00:57.724 --> 00:01:01.186
Then they would have to stay here with me.

18
00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:04.231
Huh. (CHUCKLES)

19
00:01:04.982 --> 00:01:06.984
(THEME MUSIC PLAYING)

20
00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:14.366
Wow!

21
00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:20.289
You are mindless blank slates.

22
00:01:20.372 --> 00:01:22.374
(TOGETHER) We are mindless blank slates.

23
00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:23.709
You have no purpose.

24
00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:25.168
(TOGETHER) We have no purpose.

25
00:01:25.252 --> 00:01:26.336
Until right now.

26
00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:27.754
(TOGETHER) Until right now.

27
00:01:27.838 --> 00:01:30.382
Congratulations. You five souls
have been chosen...

28
00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:32.050
(TOGETHER)
Congratulations, you five souls...

29
00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:34.011
No, stop it.
Don't repeat that part. Stop it.

30
00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:36.180
Don't repeat that part. Stop it.

31
00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:39.892
You have been selected to be members
of an exclusive, secret organization

32
00:01:39.975 --> 00:01:41.894
whose only purpose is to prevent souls

33
00:01:41.977 --> 00:01:44.396
from going to
the dumb planet known as Earth.

34
00:01:44.479 --> 00:01:48.442
Does our unstoppable gang
have a really cool name? Yes, it does.

35
00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:51.403
We shall be known as The Apocalypse.

36
00:01:54.573 --> 00:01:55.574
You can repeat that.

37
00:01:55.657 --> 00:01:57.534
-ZIMMY: Amock-a-trips!
-(CONFUSED MUMBLING)

38
00:01:57.618 --> 00:01:58.660
MOONBEAM: A-pick-a-fizz!

39
00:01:58.744 --> 00:02:01.788
Apocalypse. Anonymous Provocateurs
and Other Culprits

40
00:02:01.872 --> 00:02:05.167
that are Against Leaving Your friends
to go to Pathetic Stupid Earth.

41
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:07.753
-But I like Earth.
-No, you don't. You hate Earth.

42
00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:09.046
I hate Earth.

43
00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:10.964
Me, too. I hate Earth.

44
00:02:11.048 --> 00:02:12.549
I hate Earth!

45
00:02:12.633 --> 00:02:15.511
-(CHANTING) I hate Earth! I hate Earth!
-Yes!

46
00:02:15.594 --> 00:02:17.721
The Apocalypse is now.

47
00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:20.224
-Follow me.
-ALL: Apocalypse now!

48
00:02:24.269 --> 00:02:27.523
Our mission, stop souls
from discovering their inspiration.

49
00:02:27.606 --> 00:02:30.567
Without inspiration,
they can't complete their Earth Pass.

50
00:02:30.651 --> 00:02:31.735
Bingo, Macaroni.

51
00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:33.654
And then they have to stay here with us.

52
00:02:33.737 --> 00:02:36.031
Oh, by the way,
I gave us all cool codenames.

53
00:02:36.114 --> 00:02:39.952
Macaroni, Zimmy, Peanut, D-pac, Moonbeam,

54
00:02:40.035 --> 00:02:42.454
Cheese, and Crackers.

55
00:02:42.538 --> 00:02:43.580
We are The Apocalypse!

56
00:02:43.664 --> 00:02:45.290
ZIMMY: Amock-a-trips!
MOONBEAM: A-pic-a-fizz!

57
00:02:45.374 --> 00:02:47.125
Steal everything you can.

58
00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:50.420
Nice job. Keep going.

59
00:02:50.504 --> 00:02:52.506
(YELLING)

60
00:02:52.589 --> 00:02:54.049
We are The Apollo-Miss!

61
00:02:54.132 --> 00:02:55.133
Yes!

62
00:02:57.052 --> 00:02:58.053
(GRUNTS)

63
00:02:58.136 --> 00:02:59.137
Go! Go!

64
00:03:01.807 --> 00:03:02.933
Nice, Peanut.

65
00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:05.060
Driving is fun!

66
00:03:07.563 --> 00:03:08.856
I'm goin' to Earth!

67
00:03:08.939 --> 00:03:11.775
No! I told you to steal, not be inspired!

68
00:03:12.109 --> 00:03:13.110
PEANUT: Whoo-hoo!

69
00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:16.238
Wait! Peanut, stop! Earth is bad!

70
00:03:17.155 --> 00:03:19.908
-Ugh. Fine. We don't need Peanut.
-I thought I was Peanut.

71
00:03:19.992 --> 00:03:21.285
In fact, this is good.

72
00:03:21.368 --> 00:03:23.537
-I'm glad Peanut left.
-Me, too.

73
00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.248
-You always agree with everything I say?
-I agree!

74
00:03:26.331 --> 00:03:29.585
You have no original thoughts
and I like that. Zimmy's a follower.

75
00:03:29.668 --> 00:03:30.711
I'm a follower!

76
00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:33.463
-No!
-Whoo-hoo!

77
00:03:33.547 --> 00:03:36.717
Not again. Zimmy, come back! Ugh!

78
00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:39.219
Hey, 22. What a coincidence.

79
00:03:39.303 --> 00:03:40.345
(WHISPERS) Deny everything.

80
00:03:40.429 --> 00:03:42.431
It's so nice
to see you making new friends.

81
00:03:42.514 --> 00:03:44.516
These aren't my friends.
I've never seen them before.

82
00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:45.726
I love 22.

83
00:03:45.809 --> 00:03:47.227
(WHISPERS) You don't know me.

84
00:03:47.311 --> 00:03:49.062
I don't know 22.

85
00:03:50.522 --> 00:03:51.940
I love lying!

86
00:03:52.024 --> 00:03:53.984
Ugh! As if Earth needs another politician.

87
00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:55.194
You can't stop us.

88
00:03:55.277 --> 00:03:57.070
We're The Acapulco-lisp.
(YELLS)

89
00:03:57.154 --> 00:03:58.989
Whoa, there. Stop it. Tickles.

90
00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:00.407
Fight the power, Moonbeam.

91
00:04:01.491 --> 00:04:04.661
-Oh, come on!
-I'm a doggie! (BARKS)

92
00:04:05.537 --> 00:04:07.289
I'd hate to be that soul's parents.

93
00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:10.083
(GROANS)

94
00:04:10.959 --> 00:04:12.085
We failed.

95
00:04:13.128 --> 00:04:14.171
I failed.

96
00:04:14.838 --> 00:04:17.966
(SIGHS) None of my friends
stay my friends.

97
00:04:18.634 --> 00:04:19.968
They all leave me.

98
00:04:21.845 --> 00:04:23.138
Except for you, Macaroni.

99
00:04:25.557 --> 00:04:26.892
Mm.

100
00:04:34.191 --> 00:04:36.068
-(GRUNTS)
-Whee!

101
00:04:37.486 --> 00:04:39.738
You've won this round, ya dumb planet.

102
00:04:39.821 --> 00:04:42.157
You can take everyone
that ever meant anything to me,

103
00:04:42.241 --> 00:04:43.659
but you'll never get this soul.

104
00:04:43.742 --> 00:04:47.120
I swear over my nonexistent body,
I will never go to Earth...

105
00:04:47.204 --> 00:04:51.416
Maybe someday 22 will finally go to Earth
and learn what the meaning of life is.

106
00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.502
Come to think of it,
what is the meaning of life?

107
00:04:53.585 --> 00:04:55.379
-You don't know?
-Nobody told me.

108
00:04:55.462 --> 00:04:58.090
Oh, it's simple, really.
We're all here for the purpose of...

109
00:04:58.173 --> 00:05:00.175
(THEME MUSIC PLAYING)

110
00:05:29.162 --> 00:05:30.289
Is that it?

111
00:05:30.831 --> 00:05:33.292
Sounds so banal when it's said out loud.

112
00:05:35.294 --> 00:05:36.545
Too bad, really.
